.TH SANCHALA-VOICE 1 "August 2026" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-voice \- Voice control and dictation for Sanchala OS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-voice
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sanchala-voice
provides local voice recognition for dictation and system control
using Whisper models. All processing runs locally for privacy.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B start
Start voice recognition
.TP
.B stop
Stop voice recognition
.TP
.B dictate
Start dictation mode
.TP
.B status
Show service status
.TP
.B models
Manage voice models
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-m, \-\-model \fINAME\fR
Select voice model
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-language \fICODE\fR
Set recognition language
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/voice/voice.toml
Configuration file
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/sanchala-voice/models/
Voice models
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sanchala-ai (1),
.BR sanchala-accessibility (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team <dev@sanchala.id>
